<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Penederm Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Penederm Inc raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Wheat First Butcher Singer analyst Patricia Bank said she raised her rating on Penederm Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- She cited the stock's recent price pullback and the brokerage's anticipation, after a recent meeting with Penederm management, that the company's momentum will be more favorable later this year and into 1997.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/4 at 6-3/4.</p>
</text>
